      virtual nodes, by id and name;
    - layout-templates · decision/circle-drawer-circles-painted-on-canvas — `data-circles` is `x,y,d,id`, and the
      circles reach the snapshot, tree and graph as virtual nodes;
    - test-plan · decision/reserved-graph-id-form — its stand half: the stand now declares virtual nodes.
  - **On a delegate's word (inputs#I2), landing PROVISIONAL:**
    - security-plan · decision/canvas-content-crossing — a full answer's line ends `n={k|-}`, a number;
    - architecture · decision/canvas-reading-diffable — a changed command's removed and added lines carry one `n=`;
      the index is positional, a stated limit;
    - design-system · decision/canvas-line-form-conventions — the tag closes the line;
    - architecture · contract/handler-coverage/canvas — a virtual node's click is listed under its own id (F5 B,
      replacing F19 A);
    - architecture · contract/nodes-widgets/virtual-nodes, or the row the wrap finds for blitz-dom's public surface —
      `VirtualNodeRole` re-exported behind `custom-widget`, an escher addition (F9 B, the operator's own word).
  - **On the founder's own F13 A (inputs#I3) — the operation on the wrap's answer card, the `rul-izni57qv` pattern
    answered by his recorded word:** security-plan · decision/virtual-node-crossing — the coverage line carries the id.
  - **Unchanged and read:** architecture · decision/canvas-label-region (F3 A); the covered rows (F4 A); the lint row
